  "abstract": "Calibration and sensitivity analysis of reference-anchored graph geometry and native probability-allocation diagnostics. The archive contains the manuscript, seven vector figures, analysis code, synthetic calibration arrays, saved measurement tables, and 24 matched representation/reference arrays. It supports fixed-object sensitivity and permutation analyses and independent numerical checks. Complete historical expression caches, all inventoried latent files and the complete historical multi-library calibration driver are not supplied."
}
